<section id="A4.SS8" class="ltx_subsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.8 </span>Architectures</h4>

<div id="A4.SS8.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We generally do not apply much regularization within the architectures (i.e., we do not use batch normalization) in order to better compare the effects of the used loss-based regularizers.</p>
</div>
<section id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">CIFAR-10/100 &amp; PathMNIST.</h6>

<div id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The architecture used is provided in the following table:</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Layer Type</span></td>
<td id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Parameters</span></td>
<td id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p2.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p2.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output Shape</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Input</td>
<td id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p2.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">-</td>
<td id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p2.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t"><math id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3\times 32\times 32" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>32</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3\times 32\times 32</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Conv2d</td>
<td id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p2.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">32 filters, <math id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3\times 3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3\times 3</annotation></semantics></math>, padding = <math id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p2.1.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="32\times 32\times 32" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>32</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>32</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">32\times 32\times 32</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p2.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.SS8.SSS0.Px1.p2.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">ReLU</td>
